PLACEHOLDER ONLY — NOT AN APPLE SIGNING KEY.

Download an APNs token signing key (.p8) from your Apple Developer account.
For local use, copy the real key to AuthKey.p8 (ignored by Git).
For deployment, put the complete PEM contents in the APNS_PRIVATE_KEY secret
of the GitHub push-staging or push-production environment.
Never commit the real key, even to a private branch.
